WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:31.958
In verse 13.34,

2
00:00:31.958 --> 00:00:33.333
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:35.833
explains through a beautiful example

4
00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:38.916
how the soul, though situated within the body,

5
00:00:38.916 --> 00:00:41.000
illuminates the entire body

6
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.125
with consciousness.

7
00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:44.916
This example clarifies the relationship

8
00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:47.750
between the soul and the body.

9
00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.708
Here the soul is called the kshetrajna

10
00:00:49.708 --> 00:00:52.333
and the body is called the kshetra.

11
00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:53.125
The soul,

12
00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:55.166
though different from the body,

13
00:00:55.166 --> 00:00:57.375
provides it consciousness,

14
00:00:57.375 --> 00:01:02.166
through which experience, movement,
and sensation become possible.

15
00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:08.000
Lord Krishna

16
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.875
compares the soul’s effect on the body

17
00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:12.291
to the sun,

18
00:01:12.291 --> 00:01:15.750
which illuminates the entire world.

19
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.708
The sun, though situated far away

20
00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:21.500
and unaffected by the earth’s activities,

21
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.541
still illuminates and activates

22
00:01:23.541 --> 00:01:25.458
life on earth.

23
00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:28.500
Because of the sun’s light, flowers bloom,

24
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:32.416
rivers flow, and life flourishes.

25
00:01:32.416 --> 00:01:33.708
But the sun itself

26
00:01:33.708 --> 00:01:37.541
remains untouched by those changes.

27
00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:41.250
In the same way the soul, situated
within the body,

28
00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:44.291
spreads consciousness and illuminates
the body.

29
00:01:44.291 --> 00:01:47.291
This consciousness pervades the entire body

30
00:01:47.291 --> 00:01:50.666
and makes sensation and action possible,

31
00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:52.333
but the soul itself

32
00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:55.916
remains unaffected by the changes of the body.

33
00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:59.000
The moment the soul leaves the body,

34
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.791
the body becomes lifeless –

35
00:02:02.791 --> 00:02:07.041
just as darkness spreads at the time of sunset.

36
00:02:07.041 --> 00:02:08.125
Understanding

37
00:02:08.125 --> 00:02:10.583
that the soul illuminates the body,

38
00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:12.041
yet remains unaffected

39
00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:13.500
by its changes,

40
00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:17.083
develops a great spiritual vision.

41
00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:18.750
One who understands this

42
00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:21.458
becomes free from bodily identification

43
00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:25.541
and recognises their true spiritual form.

44
00:02:25.541 --> 00:02:26.291
This vairagya

45
00:02:26.291 --> 00:02:29.416
leads them toward liberation, where the soul

46
00:02:29.416 --> 00:02:31.916
rises above material existence

47
00:02:31.916 --> 00:02:34.166
and returns to its original state –

48
00:02:34.166 --> 00:02:38.333
a blissful relationship with the Paramatma.

49
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.250
You have never directly

50
00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:47.750
seen your soul,

51
00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.000
but have you

52
00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:53.666
ever reflected on your consciousness?

53
00:02:53.666 --> 00:02:56.791
It is worth knowing that consciousness

54
00:02:56.791 --> 00:02:58.416
is that very awareness

55
00:02:58.416 --> 00:03:01.791
through which you experience life –

56
00:03:01.791 --> 00:03:05.541
your thoughts, your emotions,
and your decisions –

57
00:03:05.541 --> 00:03:09.708
these are the light of your soul.

58
00:03:09.708 --> 00:03:13.791
Just as to know where the sun is,

59
00:03:13.791 --> 00:03:17.083
you do not need to look at it directly –

60
00:03:17.083 --> 00:03:19.750
its light, its warmth,

61
00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:23.041
and its power to bring life into the world –

62
00:03:23.041 --> 00:03:23.791
all these

63
00:03:23.791 --> 00:03:27.791
are sufficient proof of its presence.

64
00:03:27.791 --> 00:03:30.791
In the same way, your consciousness

65
00:03:30.791 --> 00:03:34.750
is the direct proof of the invisible soul.

66
00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:37.375
Just consider – when the sun

67
00:03:37.375 --> 00:03:40.500
does not rise for several days,

68
00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:44.333
what does life become? –

69
00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:50.625
everything dull, cold, lifeless.

70
00:03:50.625 --> 00:03:54.000
Something similar happens when you

71
00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.208
neglect your inner light.

72
00:03:57.208 --> 00:04:02.000
When you forget your spiritual identity,

73
00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:02.666
your

74
00:04:02.666 --> 00:04:07.166
consciousness gets covered by
doubts, negativity,

75
00:04:07.166 --> 00:04:09.916
and worries –

76
00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:13.583
and you begin to live as merely a shadow

77
00:04:13.583 --> 00:04:15.708
of your true form.

78
00:04:15.708 --> 00:04:16.958
Taking care of the body

79
00:04:16.958 --> 00:04:18.541
is necessary! But

80
00:04:18.541 --> 00:04:22.250
it is the protection of consciousness
that truly keeps you

81
00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:25.958
alive from within.

82
00:04:25.958 --> 00:04:28.458
Whenever you feel burdened

83
00:04:28.458 --> 00:04:33.375
or lost, pause for a moment –

84
00:04:33.375 --> 00:04:36.833
and increase your inner light –

85
00:04:36.833 --> 00:04:40.250
through prayer, reflection, meaningful study,

86
00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:44.500
or a few moments of quiet presence.

87
00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:46.750
When consciousness is pure,

88
00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:50.375
you do not merely stay alive –

89
00:04:50.375 --> 00:04:55.000
you begin to shine, just

90
00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:56.666
like the sun.

91
00:05:01.333 --> 00:05:04.958
Just look around you –

92
00:05:04.958 --> 00:05:07.666
what do you find? You will find

93
00:05:07.666 --> 00:05:11.250
that a very large part

94
00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:16.250
of today’s culture is focused on pulling
your consciousness downward.

95
00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.833
What you watch,

96
00:05:17.833 --> 00:05:19.833
what you discuss,

97
00:05:19.833 --> 00:05:21.708
what you chase –

98
00:05:21.708 --> 00:05:27.666
all of this is for the satisfaction of the senses,

99
00:05:27.666 --> 00:05:30.958
not for the nourishment of the soul.

100
00:05:30.958 --> 00:05:33.541
Our attention stays on appearances,

101
00:05:33.541 --> 00:05:36.750
objects, and achievements, but

102
00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:41.625
rarely on awareness, reflection, and values.

103
00:05:41.625 --> 00:05:42.375
Slowly

104
00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:46.291
we stop thinking deeply,

105
00:05:46.291 --> 00:05:49.666
we forget to experience true emotions,

106
00:05:49.666 --> 00:05:53.458
and we drift away from the real purpose of life.

107
00:05:53.458 --> 00:05:56.291
Completely different from this,

108
00:05:56.291 --> 00:05:59.000
the culture based on ancient teachings

109
00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.708
like the Gita was consciousness-centred.

110
00:06:02.708 --> 00:06:08.958
The question was not – ‘What do I have?’ But –

111
00:06:08.958 --> 00:06:11.041
‘Who am I?’

112
00:06:11.041 --> 00:06:15.958
And this thinking changed the entire direction.

113
00:06:15.958 --> 00:06:18.833
Families were adorned not only with comfort,

114
00:06:18.833 --> 00:06:22.625
but with character.

115
00:06:22.625 --> 00:06:26.708
Conversations were not only
about convenience,

116
00:06:26.708 --> 00:06:30.833
but about meaning and purpose.

117
00:06:30.833 --> 00:06:35.666
If you want to bring light into your home –

118
00:06:35.666 --> 00:06:38.208
give attention to consciousness.

119
00:06:38.208 --> 00:06:41.666
Small habits – such as beginning the day

120
00:06:41.666 --> 00:06:46.125
with gratitude, reading spiritual texts together,

121
00:06:46.125 --> 00:06:47.875
having open-hearted conversations,

122
00:06:47.875 --> 00:06:51.458
and removing pointless distractions –

123
00:06:51.458 --> 00:06:53.416
make

124
00:06:53.416 --> 00:06:55.958
the family’s culture one

125
00:06:55.958 --> 00:07:00.750
that once again brings everyone closer.

126
00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:04.500
When the home is consciousness-centred –

127
00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.958
love deepens, clarity grows,

128
00:07:07.958 --> 00:07:11.791
and peace becomes natural.

129
00:07:11.791 --> 00:07:14.125
Do not let the noise of the modern world

130
00:07:14.125 --> 00:07:18.375
suppress the voice of your soul.

131
00:07:18.375 --> 00:07:19.750
Stay aware.

132
00:07:24.541 --> 00:07:28.000
You may have heard –

133
00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.458
‘That person is the soul of this place,’

134
00:07:30.458 --> 00:07:35.666
or ‘that person is the life of this organisation.’

135
00:07:35.666 --> 00:07:37.541
This does not mean that

136
00:07:37.541 --> 00:07:39.458
the person makes every decision

137
00:07:39.458 --> 00:07:41.958
or is present in every meeting.

138
00:07:41.958 --> 00:07:43.083
Rather –

139
00:07:43.083 --> 00:07:47.000
their influence is felt everywhere,

140
00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:51.666
quiet and constant – like the soul in the body,

141
00:07:51.666 --> 00:07:53.875
or the sun in the world,

142
00:07:53.875 --> 00:07:57.541
giving light to all without making any noise.

143
00:07:57.541 --> 00:08:01.125
Such people raise the morale of the team,

144
00:08:01.125 --> 00:08:04.750
show purpose even in ordinary tasks,

145
00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.333
and create an atmosphere of integrity

146
00:08:07.333 --> 00:08:10.541
simply through their presence.

147
00:08:10.541 --> 00:08:14.208
Even if they are not at the centre of discussion –

148
00:08:14.208 --> 00:08:18.208
their values, energy, and clarity

149
00:08:18.208 --> 00:08:24.250
keep spreading positivity in the
workplace culture.

150
00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:26.833
Now ask yourself –

151
00:08:26.833 --> 00:08:28.291
do you only want to

152
00:08:28.291 --> 00:08:32.500
‘work’ in your organisation,

153
00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:36.083
or do you want to become its ‘soul’?

154
00:08:36.083 --> 00:08:40.708
For this, do not chase power or position.

155
00:08:40.708 --> 00:08:45.083
Instead – give attention to
inner clarity, steadiness,

156
00:08:45.083 --> 00:08:50.541
and the tendency to lift others up.

157
00:08:50.541 --> 00:08:53.791
Just as the soul illuminates the body,

158
00:08:53.791 --> 00:08:54.875
in the same way

159
00:08:54.875 --> 00:08:59.125
your consciousness illuminates the workplace.

160
00:08:59.125 --> 00:09:02.833
And when people, after spending time with you,

161
00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:05.875
feel a little more focused, inspired,

162
00:09:05.875 --> 00:09:09.208
or hopeful –

163
00:09:09.208 --> 00:09:11.500
then understand

164
00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:17.458
that you have truly made a positive difference.
